  "prefLabel": "Bar 701.01 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 701.01 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Mobile barbershop” means “mobile barbershop” as defined in RSA 313-A:1, XI, namely “a vehicle or structure, readily mobile, designed, constructed or adapted to serve as a barbershop at multiple sites.”\n\nSource. #13128, eff 10-30-20; ss by #14660, eff 10-15-26, EXPIRES: 10-15-36",
